  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Four Guardian Vines",
      "type": "feature",
      "_id": "mi77DiB56pclSKlN",
      "img": "icons/magic/nature/vines-thorned-curled-glow-green.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>The Healer's Folly begins with 4 active vines. When a creature first moves within Very Close range, the vines rise and the plant becomes hostile. A creature within Very Close range can use an action to attempt to wrestle one vine into submission with a Strength Roll (12). On a success, subdue one active vine. On a success with Hope, the creature may instead subdue two vines. On a failure, no vine is subdued. When all four vines are subdued, the Healer's Folly stops attacking and its nectar can be safely harvested.</p>",
        "resource": null,
        "actions": {
          "xjkJL6BrOqSD8kLp": {
            "type": "effect",
            "_id": "xjkJL6BrOqSD8kLp",
