      "img": "icons/magic/nature/vines-thorned-curled-glow-green.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>The healing nectar is biologically linked to the four defensive vines. If the Healer's Folly marks any HP from an attack that cuts, burns, shoots, or otherwise seriously damages a vine, the nectar immediately becomes unstable and cannot be harvested as a healing salve. Non-injurious restraint, pinning, shielding, netting, or similar creative subdual does not spoil the nectar.</p>",
